  "description": "Interactive CLI that syncs Azure DevOps work items with Excel. Pull a work item hierarchy into a spreadsheet, edit it locally, then push changes back — with a dry-run preview before anything is written. Works with Agile, Scrum, CMMI, and custom process templates. Install with: dotnet tool install -g AzureDevOpsExcelSync",
